===Noun===
{{en-noun|rivalr|ies}}

# The [[relationship]] between two or more [[rival]]s who regularly [[compete]] with each other. The term usually applies to two rivals.
#: ''The Boston Bruins have a longstanding '''rivalry''' with the Montreal Canadiens.''

